(text "Notes\n1. Select (C B A) = SEL_C SEL_B SEL_A: 000-011 coax IN0-IN3, 100-111 optical IN4-IN7. MUTE high: all ~SELn high, output held high. Pull-downs: IN0, unmuted.\n2. Everything runs at 5 V. 74HC needs VIH >= 3.5 V: drive SEL/MUTE from switches to 5V or 5 V logic. For ESP32 3.3 V GPIO, fit a 74HCT138 as U1.\n3. Coax slicer: U4 gate self-biased by 10k, gain ~ 10k/1k; U5 Schmitt squares it. If it oscillates with no cable, raise 1k to 2.2k.\n4. Coax out: U4E and U4F each through 750 (375 combined) + 91 shunt = ~73 ohm source, ~0.5 Vpp into 75 ohm. Separate resistors avoid tying outputs directly.\n5. T1-T5: Pulse PE-65612 (1:1; obsolete, PE-65812 is the SMD substitute). RCA shells connect only to the transformer, never to GND.\n6. TOSLINK: DLR1150 (1 OUT, 2 GND, 3 VCC) / DLT1150 (1 GND, 2 VCC, 3 IN), 16 Mbps, 5 V. 47u + 100n supply filter each. DLR1150 pinout taken from DLR1160; footprint peg position from DLT1150A drawing, check against delivered parts.\n7. No footprint yet: J3-J7 (RCA jacks), T1-T5. Unused U5E, U5F inputs tied to GND.\n8. esp32dif: Digi+ RCA out goes to any coax input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 14 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fd1fcf51-242a-4928-8797-0f208376b0ad"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
